  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE JOINT ISDB/ ISFD/ GPE SMARTED PROJECT FOR IMPROVING THE QUALITY AND EFFICIENCY OF EDUCATION SERVICES IN THE REPUBLIC OF UZBEKISTAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the overarching priorities identified in the Partnership Compact document including equitable access to quality education to be facilitated by interventions in the following priority areas: i) Improving access to student friendly learning environment including construction and equipment of new schools; ii) Improving quality and efficiency of the education services; iii) Improving the quality of pre-school education.</narrative>
  </description>
